coshTest is test
coshTest purpose "cosh and coshf give the correctly rounded value (within 1 ulp for double, exactly for float) and Annex F's special cases"
coshTest verifies hyperbolicCosine cosineIsAccurate
coshTest verifies hyperbolicCosineFloat coshfIsAccurate
