tanhTest is test
tanhTest purpose "tanh and tanhf give the correctly rounded value (within 1 ulp for double, exactly for float) and Annex F's special cases"
tanhTest verifies hyperbolicTangent tangentIsAccurate
tanhTest verifies hyperbolicTangentFloat tanhfIsAccurate
tanhTest typeParameter none
