atanhTest is test
atanhTest purpose "atanh and atanhf give the correctly rounded value (within 1 ulp for double, exactly for float) and Annex F's special cases"
atanhTest verifies inverseHyperbolicTangent atanhIsAccurate
atanhTest verifies inverseHyperbolicTangentFloat atanhfIsAccurate
